<title>UK: Norway's Statfjord to load 28 cargoes in March.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statfjord to load 28 cargoes in March.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statfjord crude system is scheduled to load 28 cargoes in March, up one from February, traders said.</p>
<p>The slightly higher loading programme reflected the longer month, they said.</p>
<p>Statfjord crude is loaded offshore in 855,000-barrel shipments.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
